<title>USA: Cyprus Amax modifies rights plan.</title>
<headline>Cyprus Amax modifies rights plan.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cyprus Amax Minerals Co said its board has authorized amendments to its shareholder rights plan to increase the threshold at which the plan is activated.</p>
<p>Previously, the rights issued under the plan would have become exercisable whenever an individual or group purchased 10 percent or more of the company's common stock.</p>
<p>The rights would become exercisable with a purchase of 20 percent of the company. If that occurs, all other holders of rights will be entitled to buy at the right's then-exercise price a number of shares of common stock having a value of twice that exercise price.</p>
<p>The amendment takes effect immediately.</p>
</text>
